{"id":"623496","name":"素锦辣酱","author":"polaris滴食记","authorId":"10301589","desc":"","cover":"images/623496/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"香干","amount":"2块"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"1个"},{"name":"杏鲍菇","amount":"50克"},{"name":"毛豆","amount":"100克"}],"sub":[{"name":"豆瓣酱","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"甜面酱","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"葡萄籽油","amount":"10毫升"},{"name":"清水","amount":"100毫升"},{"name":"淀粉水","amount":"50毫升"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"锅内倒入10毫升葡萄籽油。","img":"images/623496/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"倒入土豆丁进行煸炒。","img":"images/623496/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒入杏鲍菇丁进行煸炒。","img":"images/623496/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入豆腐干丁继续煸炒。","img":"images/623496/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入毛豆继续煸炒均匀。","img":"images/623496/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入1勺甜面酱。","img":"images/623496/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入1勺豆瓣酱。","img":"images/623496/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入100毫升清水，大火煮开。","img":"images/623496/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煮开后转中小火炖煮10分钟。","img":"images/623496/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"淋上淀粉水，轻轻推动让其汁水收干后即可出锅。","img":"images/623496/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"低卡低脂，又超级下饭好吃。","img":"images/623496/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}